"""온라인 추론 입력 레코드의 필수 필드와 승인 상태를 점검한다."""
from dataclasses import dataclass
from typing import Any

TOPIC = "온라인 추론"
REQUIRED_FIELDS = ("evidence", "owner", "status")

@dataclass(frozen=True)
class CheckResult:
    valid: bool
    missing: tuple[str, ...]

def validate_record(record: dict[str, Any]) -> CheckResult:
    missing = tuple(field for field in REQUIRED_FIELDS if not record.get(field))
    return CheckResult(valid=not missing, missing=missing)

if __name__ == "__main__":
    sample = {"evidence": "evaluation.json", "owner": "reviewer", "status": "pending"}
    result = validate_record(sample)
    print({"topic": TOPIC, "valid": result.valid, "missing": result.missing})
